@YH62284741 What do you mean by completely new industry? 

I’ve liked space companies like $RKLB since 2024 and well aware there’s a gap that needs to be bridged. 

But my opinion is that Rocketlab does build into what SpaceX is today, and there’s room for others in the final frontier.

@BullishWiener I'm happy $GOOGL is being more aggressive with supply procurement like $NVDA was.

They've been way too complacent and let others bottleneck their own supply chain. 

CSPs and hyperscalers will be in a rude awakening if they're hoping for Chinese memory to save them.

@AllTheWayRay8 I have positions in Agility! I do want to see US humanoid programs succeed, even if they’re behind Unitree and others now.

So I have a personal preference in funding US players over foreign programs. 

But $NVDA and $AMZN are heavily backing Agility so that’s always positive
